BManx2000 wrote:

> In sokoban, I stupidly blocked off the down staircase with a boulder. I
> have no means of destroying the boulder. Am I trapped in here?

No, if you don't mind losing your potions and other breakables (at least
temporarily) and you're not currently wearing anything cursed.

Strip down, take off all jewellery, and drop everything next to the
boulder. Stand back one space and kick your stuff under the boulder
(except potions and other things made of glass). Squeeze past the
boulder. You're now on the same space as the boulder, all or most of your
stuff, and the down staircase. (Note: this will cost you one point of
luck but it's easy enough to get that back)

Pick up your stuff. Go down the stairs. 

Acquire a pick-axe or a wand of striking or a force bolt spell, or better
still, a wand of teleportation, and come back to get the boulder out of
the way and pick up your potions and finish Sokoban.

Or, if the boulder isn't in the way, finish Sokoban first.

If you're not on the lowest level and there's still at least one hole
left, you don't need the staircase; you can just step through the hole.

   Raisse, killed by a boulder


